	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Nosti, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> doctissime, quę tecum de Apocalypsi <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><persName ref="p5837">Sebastiani</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Den Apokalypsenkommentar von <persName ref="p5837">Sebastian Meyer</persName> hatte <persName ref="p3700">Rümlang</persName> am 6. August zur Begutachtung an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> gesandt, s. oben <ref target="file11200">Nr. 1157</ref>, 1-13 mit Anm. 1.</note> sim locutus et quod eam quoque per <lb xml:id="p1z3"/><persName ref="p18308">Quirinum</persName><note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p18308">Quirinus von Leiden</persName>.</note> percensendam<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">percensendam <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> miserim; sed plane nihil respondisti, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ut sepius dubitarim, num tibi sit reddita.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p18308">Quirinus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>asseruit, dum inquirebam hoc ab eo, se bona fide <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>pertulisse.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Interim <persName ref="p5837">Sebastianus</persName>, dum nihil scribis, inter<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ceptam suspicatus est deque eo sępius mecum egit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Sed quia a nuperrimis <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName> scriptis<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Die Rede ist von <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> Schreiben an die reformierten Städte der Eidgenossenschaft vom 1. Dezember 1537 (s. oben <ref target="file11139">Nr. 1096</ref>, Anm. 1) und vom 27. Juni 1538 (s. oben <ref target="file11194">Nr. 1151</ref>, Anm. 2).</note> non ita <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>bene inter nos convenit, quod ea scripta parum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>mihi satisfaciant egoque multo clariora et in<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tegriora expectarim, propemodum simultates quasdam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>non dissimulat, quibus tamen nihil commoveor; <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>non habet occasionem.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Palam loquor me falsum a <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><persName ref="p467">Bucero</persName>, quod arbitratus sim et crediderim <persName ref="p1974">Lutherum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>non nihil concessisse; sed hoc literę eius non referunt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Ceterum nuperrime sumpta occasione de Apocalypsi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>mecum expostulavit ac tantum non perfidię insimulavit; <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>repetebat quoque librum.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Peto itaque, ut per certum n<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>uncium hoc, quam brevi fieri potest et celerrime<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">hoc, quam celerrime <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi> ...</note>, in meis expensis mihi mittas, quo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>liber illi reddatur, ut de me nihil possit quęri.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Libenter plura scriberem, si negotia suppeditarent <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>otium.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Quęso, scribere velis, quę meditemini.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Vellem apologiam vulgari, ut sententia vestra omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nota fieret.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed institui brevi me <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>concessurum consiliumque nostrum coram expositurum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Salutat te plurimum protographus<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Stadtschreiber <persName ref="p4610">Peter Cyro</persName>.</note> noster, meus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>fidelissimus frater et amicus, <persName ref="p2810">Erasmus</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p2810">Erasmus Ritter</persName>.</note> quoque, et ego in<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>primis.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Vellem te protographo nostro scribere<pb type="edition" next="292"/> eumque <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>consolari super afflictione, quam nuperrime propter <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>veritatem sacramentalem cum <persName ref="p5837">Sebastiano</persName> coram <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>secretioribus<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Heimlicher des Jahres 1538/39 waren <persName ref="p20969">Hans von Erlach</persName>, <persName ref="p2305">Hans Franz Nägeli</persName>, <persName ref="p4276">Peter Berchter</persName> und <persName ref="p6352">Michael Sager</persName>; s. Fabian, Geheime Räte 361 (zum Amt des Heimlichers s. ebd., S. 342f).</note> habuerit, ubi multis modis oppugnabatur<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Über diesen Vorfall ist sonst nichts bekannt.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>neque<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vor</hi> neque <hi>gestrichenes</hi> s.</note> dissimules, si scribis, te hoc meo hortatu <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>fecisse.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Unanimes maxime sumus et idem sentimus.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Gratissimum mihi fuerit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Quęso, quae scribo, celes et <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>recondas, ne arcana videar evulgare; alioqui <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>parum esset tutum scribere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale plurimum et <lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8171">Theodor Bibliander</persName>.</note> plus millies nomine meo<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>in der Vorlage irrtümlich</hi> me.</note> salutabis.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Libellus articulorum <persName ref="p1974">Lutheri</persName>, quos ad concilium <placeName ref="l1060">Mantuanum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>instituit<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Gemeint ist die 1538 erschienene Druckausgabe der Schmalkaldischen Artikel (<bibl source="b671">WA</bibl> L 160-254).</note>, ecclesiastis nostris iudicandus est datus, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>qui de sacramento altaris<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>in der Vorlage irrtümlich</hi> altari.</note> mihi displicet nullo soluto <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>tropo<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Im Vorjahr war den <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Pfarrern untersagt worden, tropische Redeweisen im Zusammenhang mit dem Abendmahl ohne Interpretation zu gebrauchen; s. <bibl source="b9">HBBW VII</bibl> <ref target="file11116">[Nr. 1073]</ref>, S. 311, 11-14.</note>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Expecto, quid de eo censeant, scribamque.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z42"/>Boni consule.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Raptim.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, in nundinis <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Lucię anno 1538.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Tuus <persName ref="p3700">Eberardus a Rümlang</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo et spectabili <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ecclesiastę <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>vigilantissimo et primario, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>domino et amico suo haud <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>vulgari.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
